    <briefdescription>
<para>Runtime replication health/lag snapshot for one replica target. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>WAL Shipper</para>
<para>Asynchronously ships WAL entries to replica shards for replication. Inspired by PostgreSQL&apos;s WAL sender process.</para>
<para>Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Background thread for continuous shipping</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Retry logic with exponential backoff</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Replication lag monitoring</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Batch shipping for efficiency</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Automatic recovery from network failures </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
